                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "a2bffadf-343a-4869-9806-c5e638b91eb7",
                        "entry_id": "7f3d7f98-e17c-36e7-b120-4eb288d77417",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "mangeuses"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d60cf4d2-3a36-3275-99c9-95c40b155a0e",
                        "entry_id": "7f3d7f98-e17c-36e7-b120-4eb288d77417",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui mange."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c0fd6749-28f4-43a2-9b7b-525346b2824e",
                                "sense_id": "d60cf4d2-3a36-3275-99c9-95c40b155a0e",
                                "text": "Et tandis que l’autre Ouroz, hors de toute atteinte, continuait à naviguer de cime en cime, celui-là se sentit alerté comme un loup très malade qui flaire, attachées à ses traces, des bêtes mangeuses de charogne."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "77e993c5-9253-4ac3-94ba-45720ac90b81",
                                "sense_id": "d60cf4d2-3a36-3275-99c9-95c40b155a0e",
                                "text": "Tous les sujets d’actualités y passèrent les uns après les autres : la nouvelle route du littoral, ainsi que les autres projets ruineux de la Région ou du Département ; la pseudo crise du tourisme due aux requins mangeurs de surfeurs…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "e227e263-cbdd-3830-a422-443e810d3c66",
                "word": "mangeur",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "35062767-fbb6-47d7-93e4-1a6575d7c2d2",
                        "entry_id": "e227e263-cbdd-3830-a422-443e810d3c66",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "mangeurs"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "72066ecb-f66c-4df3-8c44-15d5fb3aba30",
                        "entry_id": "e227e263-cbdd-3830-a422-443e810d3c66",
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "mangeuse"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "9b1d6d0a-d758-4bed-8811-fd2102b9bae3",
                        "entry_id": "e227e263-cbdd-3830-a422-443e810d3c66",
                        "tags": [
                            "Québec"
                        ],
                        "form": "mangeux"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7385dbf4-aeb7-34e4-8fec-d4afd1053d57",
                        "entry_id": "e227e263-cbdd-3830-a422-443e810d3c66",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Celui qui mange."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "note": "S’emploie ordinairement avec une épithète",
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b327a7d8-98e9-4a72-a0c7-3303535f4b9b",
                                "sense_id": "7385dbf4-aeb7-34e4-8fec-d4afd1053d57",
                                "text": "Je serais d’accord avec Singer, mais à une seule condition, dire la même chose concernant les végétaux, être aussi un mangeur de céréales consciencieux !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ff4559e-9d6e-4364-b88e-95c557bf699e",
                                "sense_id": "7385dbf4-aeb7-34e4-8fec-d4afd1053d57",
                                "text": "Mon oncle avait une longue canne, terminée par une brochette de fer, au moyen de laquelle il enfilait les limaces et les escargots, mangeurs de salades."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7565e18f-0c7c-424f-b70c-2d31b0b59268",
                                "sense_id": "7385dbf4-aeb7-34e4-8fec-d4afd1053d57",
                                "text": "Lorsque a commencé en Afrique la colonisation à proprement parler, la métaphore du cannibalisme a été adoptée par les Européens, qui l’ont retournée contre les Africains. C’étaient maintenant les Africains qui étaient les cannibales, mangeurs de missionnaires."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c780aaff-3667-34aa-8836-ad849b231a7e",
                        "entry_id": "e227e263-cbdd-3830-a422-443e810d3c66",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ce qui consomme ; ce qui absorbe ; ce qui détruit."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2208d7d3-7743-45de-9a4d-f3e9ab130d0d",
                                "sense_id": "c780aaff-3667-34aa-8836-ad849b231a7e",
                                "text": "C’étaient de grosses voix, fortes, malgré le vent et la présence de la mer, mangeuse de bruits."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b24caf86-501e-3840-b048-b85a19974d1f",
                        "entry_id": "e227e263-cbdd-3830-a422-443e810d3c66",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Consommateur de produits alimentaires."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Didactique"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8fc21984-df3e-4d12-b8f5-dc825c99b34b",
                                "sense_id": "b24caf86-501e-3840-b048-b85a19974d1f",
                                "text": "Au-delà de ce risque politique, les distanciations géographiques, économiques, cognitives et politiques, génèrent une crise de confiance des mangeurs vis-à-vis de leur système alimentaire, accentuée par les asymétries de pouvoir."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b3a3e9f3-a812-4cea-b69f-6291ebacff42",
                        "source_entry_id": "e227e263-cbdd-3830-a422-443e810d3c66",
                        "target_lang_word": "eater",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "eater",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a3b7cf9-3b96-3c9b-9592-1533bc3dfa53",
                                        "entry_id": "c365272b-ae5e-352b-9f50-33d28e54ce39",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person or animal who eats."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6fbabb81-485d-4b65-8b03-013d5dac8acd",
                                                "sense_id": "6a3b7cf9-3b96-3c9b-9592-1533bc3dfa53",
                                                "text": "Ice cream tastes good to the eater, and has the added advantage of providing a little chill of excitement […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5cfeed6-579d-4b4b-9713-cd26d0e91807",
                                                "sense_id": "6a3b7cf9-3b96-3c9b-9592-1533bc3dfa53",
                                                "text": "2001, Cool Sexy Guy, Story: Cheerleading Camp Group: alt.sex\nThe girls were having lots of fun rolling around on the bed, though Kacie was a much better fingerer and occasional eater."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4c3336a-666c-40c2-b573-069ce8326ec1",
                                                "sense_id": "6a3b7cf9-3b96-3c9b-9592-1533bc3dfa53",
                                                "text": "\"He is the right sort of man for a labourer, but he is a terrible eater, to be sure,\" thought the farmer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9b79ea1-5c03-4c05-bdf8-11f9f00cf689",
                                                "sense_id": "6a3b7cf9-3b96-3c9b-9592-1533bc3dfa53",
                                                "text": "\"Eaters of human flesh, two things have ye done. First, ye have attacked these strangers, being white men, and would have slain their servant, and for that alone death is your reward.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa9b78cc-c370-4f7c-88f3-248fdcf78e2d",
                                                "sense_id": "6a3b7cf9-3b96-3c9b-9592-1533bc3dfa53",
                                                "text": "Coal-eaters they may have been, but a more willing or harder working Atlantic engine was never designed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c401c66-54f4-444e-be30-3d210019ba1d",
                                                "sense_id": "6a3b7cf9-3b96-3c9b-9592-1533bc3dfa53",
                                                "text": "I'm a slow but fastidious eater"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d13ccd32-fcaf-346e-baeb-8984085ad506",
                                        "entry_id": "c365272b-ae5e-352b-9f50-33d28e54ce39",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fruit or other food that is suitable for eating, especially one that is intended to be eaten uncooked."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1962075-9d71-49f3-a9ad-a1c20c31f488",
                                                "sense_id": "d13ccd32-fcaf-346e-baeb-8984085ad506",
                                                "text": "The bass is a fine eater."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a972652f-a459-4a77-9232-98f278fdc676",
                                                "sense_id": "d13ccd32-fcaf-346e-baeb-8984085ad506",
                                                "text": "For the British market, apples are classed as early, mid-season, or late, and subdivided into eaters or cookers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "91a5136e-b3f5-3435-9886-a6fad5775c15",
                                        "entry_id": "c365272b-ae5e-352b-9f50-33d28e54ce39",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A configuration of cells that appears to consume another configuration by gradually causing it to disappear."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "391cb5ce-d0d0-4612-b7e2-c5d473370275",
                                                "sense_id": "91a5136e-b3f5-3435-9886-a6fad5775c15",
                                                "text": "But there are many queen bee configurations in which the debris is neutralized, including placement of a block or eater near the bee's turnaround point, or placing two queen bees in a line or at right angles in various positions and phases."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50737194-2575-46fc-b8d8-db88d0440bef",
                                                "sense_id": "91a5136e-b3f5-3435-9886-a6fad5775c15",
                                                "text": "The eater can also destroy a snail, but changes its phase while doing so."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0b02d54-e337-481a-9ebe-ce74cefe475b",
                                                "sense_id": "91a5136e-b3f5-3435-9886-a6fad5775c15",
                                                "text": "Probably even if it didn't fail catastrophically, any design like this would get stuck in an infinite loop pretty quick, upon hitting its first \"cleaner-proof\" ash -- an eater pattern that happens to absorb the test reaction without itself being altered."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
